  "description": "This is the .NET Client for the GAEB365.online API. The API enables access to GAEB365.online projects in the context of the authorized user. \n\t\t\tThe API also includes the GAEB Check, which checks whether a GAEB file matches the GAEB DA XML 3.0, 3.1, 3.2 or 3.3 specifications. \n\t\t\tThe GAEB Converter is also included to convert a GAEB file to another GAEB version. \n\t\t\t- Usage: new Anouri.GAEB365.API.ApiService(...)",
